return {
    ["\"正义\"：这个世界有很多非凡者 ，非凡力量的基石表现为——22条非凡途径。\n\"正义\"：每一条途径，从序列9开始，越往前，数字越小，代表的力量层次越高。"] = "\"Justice\": There are many Beyonders in this world. The foundation of Beyonder powers is represented by—22 Beyonder Pathways. \n\"Justice\": For every pathway, starting from Sequence 9, the further forward you go, the smaller the number, representing a higher level of power.",
    ["***，不工作天上会掉便士吗。这种活给的钱比地上的多多了！"] = "***, will pennies fall from the sky if I don't work? This kind of job pays much more than the ones on the ground!",
