    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Audience Seat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Life</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Two Nighthawk colleagues from Enmat Port have come to Blackthorn, and they seem to need help.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>64</>, head to {Location:[黑荆棘安保公司(100,106)]|15;460;-1;2;5200004;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Audience Seat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Life</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Two Nighthawk colleagues from Enmat Port have come to Blackthorn, and they seem to need help.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>64</>, head to {Location:[Blackthorn Security Company(100,106)]|15;460;-1;2;5200004;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【俱乐部-建筑和资金】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>菜单-俱乐部-建筑升级</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250318}\n<Assistant_Title2>资金来源：</>俱乐部活跃津贴和俱乐部活动。\n<Assistant_Title2>资金说明：</>可用于俱乐部建筑升级，提升俱乐部实力、福利和规模。\n<Assistant_Title2>俱乐部资金消耗：</>建筑升级需要消耗俱乐部资金，并且需要等待一定时间。每个建筑都有对应的等级提升效果，其他建筑等级不能超过议事厅的等级。\n<Assistant_Title2>建筑升级上限随服务器时间逐步开放</>3级：开服第7天早晨8点后\n4级：开服第14天早晨8点后\n5级：开服第21天早晨8点后\n6级：开服第30天早晨8点后\n7级：开服第45天早晨8点后\n8级：开服第60天早晨8点后 \n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部]|1400}，{SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部职位]|1402}，{SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部活跃]|1403}，{SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部活跃津贴]|1404}，"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club-Buildings and Funds】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Menu-Club-Building Upgrade</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250318}\n<Assistant_Title2>Source of Funds: </>Club Activity Allowance and Club Activities.\n<Assistant_Title2>Fund Description: </>Can be used for Club building upgrades to increase Club strength, benefits, and scale.\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Fund Consumption: </>Building upgrades consume Club funds and require a certain amount of time to complete. Each building has corresponding level-up effects, and other building levels cannot exceed the level of the Council Hall.\n<Assistant_Title2>Building upgrade caps are gradually unlocked based on server time:</>Level 3: After 8 AM on the 7th day of the server launch\nLevel 4: After 8 AM on the 14th day of the server launch\nLevel 5: After 8 AM on the 21st day of the server launch\nLevel 6: After 8 AM on the 30th day of the server launch\nLevel 7: After 8 AM on the 45th day of the server launch\nLevel 8: After 8 AM on the 60th day of the server launch \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Positions]|1402}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity]|1403}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity Allowance]|1404},",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【厨王之王】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>廷根最火爆的海岸线餐厅门前排起了长队，美食评论家马西莫的一篇《厨王之王》让主厨库克名声大噪。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>59级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(973,844)]|-2653;-15305;-1390;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【King of Chefs】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Tides of the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A long line has formed in front of the Coastline Restaurant, the hottest spot in Tingen. A piece titled \"King of Chefs\" by food critic Massimo has made Chef Cook famous.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main storyline, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>59</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(973,844)]|-2653;-15305;-1390;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Bound Soules, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
